OL,3,GNEWSAMayor backs school absences for
OL,4,ALincolnshire Show
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior councillors have agreed to write
OL,7,Fto schools asking them to give pupils
OL,8,Fthe day off to go to the Lincolnshire
OL,9,FShow.
OL,11,FThe Mayor of Greater Lincolnshire Dame
OL,12,FAndrea Jenkyns said the event played an
OL,13,Fimportant role in showcasing the
OL,14,Fcounty's farming industry and inspiring
OL,15,Fyoung people to pursue careers in the
OL,16,Fsector.
OL,18,FChris Wilkinson, who received a fixed
OL,19,Fpenalty warning after taking his sons
OL,20,Fout of school to attend the show last
OL,21,Fyear, said he was "delighted" by the
OL,22,Fproposal.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
