OL,3,GNEWSAMayor backs school absences for
OL,4,ALincolnshire Show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Education said head
OL,7,Fteachers had sole discretion to grant
OL,8,Fan authorised absence in exceptional
OL,9,Fcircumstances, but this was "up to the
OL,10,Fschool's individuual judgement, not a
OL,11,Fguaranteed entitlement".
